<section class="portfolio" data-portfolio aria-label="Alternative portfolio calculator">
 <h3>What does diversification change?</h3><p>Three illustrative sleeves. Drag an allocation to rebalance the other two proportionally.</p>
 <div class="presets"><button data-preset="100,0,0">60/40 Traditional</button><button data-preset="40,35,25">Endowment Model</button><button data-preset="30,55,15">Private Credit Heavy</button></div>
 <div class="sliders">{['Public stocks & bonds (60/40 sleeve)','Private equity & private debt','Real assets & hedge funds'].map((label,i)=><label>{label}<span data-weight={i}></span><input type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value={[60,25,15][i]} data-allocation={i}/></label>)}</div>
 <svg viewBox="0 0 420 240" role="img" aria-label="Expected annual return against annual volatility"><path d="M48 15V202H405" fill="none" stroke="var(--border-subtle)"/><g data-grid></g><path data-frontier fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-primary)" stroke-width="3"/><circle data-point r="6" fill="var(--accent-highlight)"/><text x="220" y="234" text-anchor="middle">Annual volatility (%)</text><text x="7" y="12">Return (%)</text></svg>
 <div class="stats" aria-live="polite" data-stats></div>
 <details><summary>Assumptions and calculation</summary><p>Illustrative annual returns: 6.5%, 9%, 6%. Volatility: 10%, 18%, 12%. Pairwise correlations: 0.65, 0.40, 0.50. Risk-free rate: 3%. The first sleeve already contains 60% public stocks and 40% bonds. Its preset allocates the entire portfolio to that sleeve. Private Credit Heavy is a blended sleeve proxy, not a separately modeled credit asset.</p><p>Variance is wᵀΣw; Sharpe is (return minus risk-free rate) divided by volatility. Correlation is the allocation-weighted average between distinct sleeves, undefined for one sleeve. The curve is the non-dominated feasible envelope on a 2% long-only grid. Drawdown proxy is max(0, 2 × volatility minus return), not an estimated historical maximum or a forecast. These are assumptions for learning, not market observations or investment advice.</p></details>
 <a href="/caia/">Explore CAIA Knowledge Hub</a>
</section>
<script>
 import {portfolio,normalize,frontier} from '../../../data/codex/islands/portfolio';
 function init(){document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-portfolio]').forEach(root=>{if(root.dataset.ready)return;root.dataset.ready='true';let weights=[60,25,15];const x=(v:number)=>48+(v-.08)/.12*350,y=(v:number)=>202-(v-.04)/.06*185;
 const path=frontier().map((p,i)=>`${i?'L':'M'}${x(p.volatility).toFixed(2)},${y(p.mean).toFixed(2)}`).join(' ');root.querySelector('[data-frontier]')!.setAttribute('d',path);
 const grid=root.querySelector('[data-grid]')!;for(const v of [8,10,12,14,16,18,20]){const t=document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg','text');t.setAttribute('x',String(x(v/100)));t.setAttribute('y','218');t.setAttribute('text-anchor','middle');t.textContent=String(v);grid.append(t);}for(const v of [4,6,8,10]){const t=document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg','text');t.setAttribute('x','40');t.setAttribute('y',String(y(v/100)+4));t.setAttribute('text-anchor','end');t.textContent=String(v);grid.append(t);}
 const render=()=>{const p=portfolio(weights);root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('[data-allocation]').forEach((slider,i)=>{slider.value=String(weights[i]);slider.setAttribute('aria-valuetext',`${weights[i].toFixed(1)} percent`);root.querySelector(`[data-weight="${i}"]`)!.textContent=`${weights[i].toFixed(1)}%`;});const dot=root.querySelector('[data-point]')!;dot.setAttribute('cx',String(x(p.volatility)));dot.setAttribute('cy',String(y(p.mean)));const stats=root.querySelector('[data-stats]')!;stats.replaceChildren();[['Return',`${(p.mean*100).toFixed(2)}%`],['Volatility',`${(p.volatility*100).toFixed(2)}%`],['Sharpe',p.sharpe.toFixed(2)],['Pair correlation',p.correlation===null?'N/A':p.correlation.toFixed(2)],['Drawdown proxy',`${(p.drawdown*100).toFixed(1)}%`]].forEach(([label,value])=>{const node=document.createElement('p');node.textContent=`${label}: ${value}`;stats.append(node);});};root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('[data-allocation]').forEach((slider,i)=>slider.addEventListener('input',()=>{weights=normalize(weights,i,Number(slider.value));render();}));root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-preset]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{weights=button.dataset.preset!.split(',').map(Number);render();}));render();});}init();document.addEventListener('astro:page-load',init);
</script>
<style>
 .portfolio{font-family:var(--font-sans);color:var(--text-primary)}h3{font:400 1.8rem var(--font-serif);margin:0 0 1rem}p{color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6}.presets{display:flex;gap:.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap}button{background:var(--bg-subtle);border:1px solid var(--border-subtle);color:var(--text-primary);padding:.6rem;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.sliders{display:grid;gap:1rem;margin:1.5rem 0}label{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.4rem;font-size:.86rem}input{grid-column:1/-1;width:100%;accent-color:var(--accent-primary)}[data-weight]{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}svg{width:100%;max-height:310px;background:var(--bg-subtle)}svg text{fill:var(--text-secondary);font:11px var(--font-mono)}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:.3rem;font: .82rem var(--font-mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}:global([data-stats] p){margin:.5rem 0}details{font-size:.8rem;margin:1rem 0}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--text-primary)}a{color:var(--accent-primary)}:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent-blue);outline-offset:3px}
</style>
